  "question": {
    "text": "If a circle passes through the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and cuts the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> orthogonally, then the locus of its centre is",
