  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the centre of the circle be <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math><br />Since it cuts the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> orthogonally,<br /><math><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> The equation of the circle is<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>β</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />It passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. So <math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Hence, the locus of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
    "image": null
  },
